<!doctype lake><title>06-数据库设计文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1>数据库设计文档：电商平台 v4.0</h1>
<blockquote><strong>文档版本</strong>：v4.0.0
<strong>文档状态</strong>：已评审
<strong>编写日期</strong>：2026-08-08
<strong>编写人</strong>：架构组</blockquote>
