<h2>一、概念结构设计</h2>
<h3>1.1 ER图（实体-联系图）</h3>
<p>ER图用于描述数据库的概念模型，包括实体、属性和实体之间的联系。</p>
<p><strong>核心实体</strong>：</p>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="266"><col width="266"><col width="266"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>实体</td><td>说明</td><td>主要属性</td></tr>
<tr><td>用户(User)</td><td>平台注册用户</td><td>用户ID、用户名、密码、手机号、邮箱</td></tr>
<tr><td>商品(Product)</td><td>平台售卖商品</td><td>商品ID、名称、价格、库存、分类</td></tr>
<tr><td>订单(Order)</td><td>用户下单记录</td><td>订单ID、用户ID、总金额、状态、时间</td></tr>
<tr><td>订单项(OrderItem)</td><td>订单中的商品明细</td><td>明细ID、订单ID、商品ID、数量、单价</td></tr>
<tr><td>支付(Payment)</td><td>订单支付记录</td><td>支付ID、订单ID、支付方式、金额、状态</td></tr>
<tr><td>优惠券(Coupon)</td><td>营销优惠券</td><td>优惠券ID、用户ID、面额、有效期</td></tr>
<tr><td>评价(Review)</td><td>商品评价</td><td>评价ID、用户ID、商品ID、评分、内容</td></tr>
<tr><td>地址(Address)</td><td>用户收货地址</td><td>地址ID、用户ID、省市区、详细地址</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><strong>实体关系</strong>：</p>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="160"><col width="160"><col width="160"><col width="160"><col width="160"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>关系</td><td>源实体</td><td>目标实体</td><td>类型</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>下单</td><td>用户</td><td>订单</td><td>1:N</td><td>一个用户可下多个订单</td></tr>
<tr><td>包含</td><td>订单</td><td>订单项</td><td>1:N</td><td>一个订单包含多个商品</td></tr>
<tr><td>支付</td><td>订单</td><td>支付</td><td>1:1</td><td>一个订单对应一次支付</td></tr>
<tr><td>评价</td><td>用户</td><td>评价</td><td>1:N</td><td>一个用户可写多个评价</td></tr>
<tr><td>拥有</td><td>用户</td><td>优惠券</td><td>1:N</td><td>一个用户可有多张优惠券</td></tr>
<tr><td>收货</td><td>用户</td><td>地址</td><td>1:N</td><td>一个用户可有多个地址</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>1.2 数据字典</h3>
<p><strong>用户表(user)数据字典</strong>：</p>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="100"><col width="100"><col width="100"><col width="100"><col width="100"><col width="100"><col width="100"><col width="100"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>字段名</td><td>数据类型</td><td>长度</td><td>主键</td><td>外键</td><td>非空</td><td>默认值</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>user_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td>20</td><td>✅</td><td>—</td><td>✅</td><td>AUTO</td><td>用户唯一标识</td></tr>
<tr><td>username</td><td>VARCHAR</td><td>50</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✅</td><td>—</td><td>用户名</td></tr>
<tr><td>password</td><td>VARCHAR</td><td>100</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✅</td><td>—</td><td>密码（BCrypt加密）</td></tr>
<tr><td>phone</td><td>VARCHAR</td><td>20</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✅</td><td>—</td><td>手机号</td></tr>
<tr><td>email</td><td>VARCHAR</td><td>100</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>❌</td><td>—</td><td>邮箱</td></tr>
<tr><td>nickname</td><td>VARCHAR</td><td>50</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>❌</td><td>—</td><td>昵称</td></tr>
<tr><td>avatar</td><td>VARCHAR</td><td>255</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>❌</td><td>—</td><td>头像URL</td></tr>
<tr><td>gender</td><td>TINYINT</td><td>1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>❌</td><td>0</td><td>性别(0:未知 1:男 2:女)</td></tr>
<tr><td>status</td><td>TINYINT</td><td>1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✅</td><td>1</td><td>状态(0:禁用 1:正常)</td></tr>
<tr><td>user_level</td><td>TINYINT</td><td>1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✅</td><td>1</td><td>用户等级(1-5)</td></tr>
<tr><td>created_at</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✅</td><td>NOW()</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>
<tr><td>updated_at</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✅</td><td>NOW()</td><td>更新时间</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22w5O9M%22%7D"></card>
<h2>二、逻辑设计（关系模型）</h2>
<h3>2.1 用户表(user)</h3>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CREATE%20TABLE%20%60user%60%20%28%5Cn%20%20%60user_id%60%20BIGINT%2820%29%20NOT%20NULL%20AUTO_INCREMENT%20COMMENT%20%27%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7ID%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60username%60%20VARCHAR%2850%29%20NOT%20NULL%20COMMENT%20%27%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%90%8D%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60password%60%20VARCHAR%28100%29%20NOT%20NULL%20COMMENT%20%27%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81%28BCrypt%29%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60phone%60%20VARCHAR%2820%29%20NOT%20NULL%20COMMENT%20%27%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%B7%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60email%60%20VARCHAR%28100%29%20DEFAULT%20NULL%20COMMENT%20%27%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60nickname%60%20VARCHAR%2850%29%20DEFAULT%20NULL%20COMMENT%20%27%E6%98%B5%E7%A7%B0%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60avatar%60%20VARCHAR%28255%29%20DEFAULT%20NULL%20COMMENT%20%27%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8FURL%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60gender%60%20TINYINT%281%29%20DEFAULT%200%20COMMENT%20%27%E6%80%A7%E5%88%AB%280%3A%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5%201%3A%E7%94%B7%202%3A%E5%A5%B3%29%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60status%60%20TINYINT%281%29%20NOT%20NULL%20DEFAULT%201%20COMMENT%20%27%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%280%3A%E7%A6%81%E7%94%A8%201%3A%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%29%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60user_level%60%20TINYINT%281%29%20NOT%20NULL%20DEFAULT%201%20COMMENT%20%27%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%AD%89%E7%BA%A7%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60created_at%60%20DATETIME%20NOT%20NULL%20DEFAULT%20CURRENT_TIMESTAMP%20COMMENT%20%27%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%60updated_at%60%20DATETIME%20NOT%20NULL%20DEFAULT%20CURRENT_TIMESTAMP%20ON%20UPDATE%20CURRENT_TIMESTAMP%20COMMENT%20%27%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%27%2C%5Cn%20%20PRIMARY%20KEY%20%28%60user_id%60%29%2C%5Cn%20%20UNIQUE%20KEY%20%60uk_username%60%20%28%60username%60%29%2C%5Cn%20%20UNIQUE%20KEY%20%60uk_phone%60%20%28%60phone%60%29%2C%5Cn%20%20UNIQUE%20KEY%20%60uk_email%60%20%28%60email%60%29%5Cn%29%20ENGINE%3DInnoDB%20DEFAULT%20CHARSET%3Dutf8mb4%20COMMENT%3D%27%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E8%A1%A8%27%3B%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22cBhfk%22%7D"></card>
<h3>2.2 商品表(product)</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>字段名</td><td>类型</td><td>主键</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>product_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td>✅</td><td>商品ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>category_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td>—</td><td>分类ID（外键）</td></tr>
<tr><td>name</td><td>VARCHAR(200)</td><td>—</td><td>商品名称</td></tr>
<tr><td>subtitle</td><td>VARCHAR(500)</td><td>—</td><td>副标题</td></tr>
<tr><td>main_image</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>—</td><td>主图URL</td></tr>
<tr><td>detail</td><td>TEXT</td><td>—</td><td>商品详情(HTML)</td></tr>
<tr><td>price</td><td>DECIMAL(10,2)</td><td>—</td><td>销售价</td></tr>
<tr><td>original_price</td><td>DECIMAL(10,2)</td><td>—</td><td>原价</td></tr>
<tr><td>stock</td><td>INT</td><td>—</td><td>库存数量</td></tr>
<tr><td>sales</td><td>INT</td><td>—</td><td>销量</td></tr>
<tr><td>status</td><td>TINYINT</td><td>—</td><td>状态(0:下架 1:上架 2:预售)</td></tr>
<tr><td>sort_order</td><td>INT</td><td>—</td><td>排序值</td></tr>
<tr><td>created_at</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>
<tr><td>updated_at</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>更新时间</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>2.3 订单表(order)</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>字段名</td><td>类型</td><td>主键</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>order_id</td><td>VARCHAR(32)</td><td>✅</td><td>订单ID（分布式ID）</td></tr>
<tr><td>user_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td>—</td><td>用户ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>order_no</td><td>VARCHAR(32)</td><td>—</td><td>订单编号</td></tr>
<tr><td>total_amount</td><td>DECIMAL(12,2)</td><td>—</td><td>订单总金额</td></tr>
<tr><td>pay_amount</td><td>DECIMAL(12,2)</td><td>—</td><td>实付金额</td></tr>
<tr><td>discount_amount</td><td>DECIMAL(12,2)</td><td>—</td><td>优惠金额</td></tr>
<tr><td>shipping_fee</td><td>DECIMAL(10,2)</td><td>—</td><td>运费</td></tr>
<tr><td>status</td><td>TINYINT</td><td>—</td><td>状态(0:待付款 1:已付款 2:已发货 3:已签收 4:已取消 5:退款中 6:已退款)</td></tr>
<tr><td>payment_method</td><td>VARCHAR(20)</td><td>—</td><td>支付方式</td></tr>
<tr><td>payment_time</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>支付时间</td></tr>
<tr><td>shipping_time</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>发货时间</td></tr>
<tr><td>receive_time</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>签收时间</td></tr>
<tr><td>address_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td>—</td><td>收货地址ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>remark</td><td>VARCHAR(500)</td><td>—</td><td>订单备注</td></tr>
<tr><td>created_at</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>
<tr><td>updated_at</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>更新时间</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>2.4 订单项表(order_item)</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>字段名</td><td>类型</td><td>主键</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>item_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td>✅</td><td>明细ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>order_id</td><td>VARCHAR(32)</td><td>—</td><td>订单ID（外键）</td></tr>
<tr><td>product_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td>—</td><td>商品ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>product_name</td><td>VARCHAR(200)</td><td>—</td><td>商品名称（快照）</td></tr>
<tr><td>product_image</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>—</td><td>商品图片（快照）</td></tr>
<tr><td>quantity</td><td>INT</td><td>—</td><td>购买数量</td></tr>
<tr><td>unit_price</td><td>DECIMAL(10,2)</td><td>—</td><td>单价（快照）</td></tr>
<tr><td>total_price</td><td>DECIMAL(12,2)</td><td>—</td><td>小计金额</td></tr>
<tr><td>created_at</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>2.5 支付记录表(payment)</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>字段名</td><td>类型</td><td>主键</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>payment_id</td><td>VARCHAR(32)</td><td>✅</td><td>支付ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>order_id</td><td>VARCHAR(32)</td><td>—</td><td>订单ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>user_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td>—</td><td>用户ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>payment_method</td><td>VARCHAR(20)</td><td>—</td><td>支付方式(alipay/wechat)</td></tr>
<tr><td>payment_no</td><td>VARCHAR(64)</td><td>—</td><td>第三方支付流水号</td></tr>
<tr><td>amount</td><td>DECIMAL(12,2)</td><td>—</td><td>支付金额</td></tr>
<tr><td>status</td><td>TINYINT</td><td>—</td><td>状态(0:待支付 1:支付中 2:成功 3:失败 4:已退款)</td></tr>
<tr><td>callback_time</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>回调时间</td></tr>
<tr><td>created_at</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>
<tr><td>updated_at</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>—</td><td>更新时间</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EgSG3%22%7D"></card>
<h2>三、物理设计</h2>
<h3>3.1 存储引擎选择</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="266"><col width="266"><col width="266"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>表名</td><td>存储引擎</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>user</td><td>InnoDB</td><td>支持事务、行级锁</td></tr>
<tr><td>product</td><td>InnoDB</td><td>支持事务</td></tr>
<tr><td>order</td><td>InnoDB</td><td>支持事务</td></tr>
<tr><td>order_item</td><td>InnoDB</td><td>支持事务</td></tr>
<tr><td>payment</td><td>InnoDB</td><td>支持事务</td></tr>
<tr><td>review</td><td>InnoDB</td><td>支持事务</td></tr>
<tr><td>coupon</td><td>InnoDB</td><td>支持事务</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>3.2 索引设计</h3>
<p><strong>用户表索引</strong>：</p>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>索引名</td><td>索引类型</td><td>字段</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>PRIMARY</td><td>主键索引</td><td>user_id</td><td>主键</td></tr>
<tr><td>uk_username</td><td>唯一索引</td><td>username</td><td>用户名唯一</td></tr>
<tr><td>uk_phone</td><td>唯一索引</td><td>phone</td><td>手机号唯一</td></tr>
<tr><td>uk_email</td><td>唯一索引</td><td>email</td><td>邮箱唯一</td></tr>
<tr><td>idx_status</td><td>普通索引</td><td>status</td><td>按状态查询</td></tr>
<tr><td>idx_created_at</td><td>普通索引</td><td>created_at</td><td>按时间查询</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><strong>订单表索引</strong>：</p>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"><col width="200"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>索引名</td><td>索引类型</td><td>字段</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>PRIMARY</td><td>主键索引</td><td>order_id</td><td>主键</td></tr>
<tr><td>uk_order_no</td><td>唯一索引</td><td>order_no</td><td>订单号唯一</td></tr>
<tr><td>idx_user_id</td><td>普通索引</td><td>user_id</td><td>按用户查询订单</td></tr>
<tr><td>idx_status</td><td>普通索引</td><td>status</td><td>按状态查询</td></tr>
<tr><td>idx_created_at</td><td>普通索引</td><td>created_at</td><td>按时间查询</td></tr>
<tr><td>idx_user_status</td><td>联合索引</td><td>user_id, status</td><td>按用户+状态查询</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>3.3 分库分表策略</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="160"><col width="160"><col width="160"><col width="160"><col width="160"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>表名</td><td>分表键</td><td>分表策略</td><td>分表数</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>order</td><td>user_id</td><td>取模</td><td>16</td><td>按用户ID分表</td></tr>
<tr><td>order_item</td><td>order_id</td><td>取模</td><td>16</td><td>跟随订单分表</td></tr>
<tr><td>payment</td><td>order_id</td><td>取模</td><td>16</td><td>跟随订单分表</td></tr>
<tr><td>review</td><td>product_id</td><td>取模</td><td>8</td><td>按商品ID分表</td></tr>
<tr><td>user</td><td>user_id</td><td>范围</td><td>4</td><td>按ID范围分表</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>3.4 分区设计</h3>
<p>对于订单表、评论表等大数据量表，可按时间进行水平分区：</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22--%20%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95%E8%A1%A8%E6%8C%89%E6%9C%88%E5%88%86%E5%8C%BA%5CnALTER%20TABLE%20%60order%60%20PARTITION%20BY%20RANGE%20%28TO_DAYS%28created_at%29%29%20%28%5Cn%20%20PARTITION%20p202601%20VALUES%20LESS%20THAN%20%28TO_DAYS%28%272026-02-01%27%29%29%2C%5Cn%20%20PARTITION%20p202602%20VALUES%20LESS%20THAN%20%28TO_DAYS%28%272026-03-01%27%29%29%2C%5Cn%20%20PARTITION%20p202603%20VALUES%20LESS%20THAN%20%28TO_DAYS%28%272026-04-01%27%29%29%2C%5Cn%20%20PARTITION%20p202604%20VALUES%20LESS%20THAN%20%28TO_DAYS%28%272026-05-01%27%29%29%2C%5Cn%20%20PARTITION%20p202605%20VALUES%20LESS%20THAN%20%28TO_DAYS%28%272026-06-01%27%29%29%2C%5Cn%20%20PARTITION%20p202606%20VALUES%20LESS%20THAN%20%28TO_DAYS%28%272026-07-01%27%29%29%2C%5Cn%20%20PARTITION%20p202607%20VALUES%20LESS%20THAN%20%28TO_DAYS%28%272026-08-01%27%29%29%2C%5Cn%20%20PARTITION%20p202608%20VALUES%20LESS%20THAN%20%28TO_DAYS%28%272026-09-01%27%29%29%2C%5Cn%20%20PARTITION%20pmax%20VALUES%20LESS%20THAN%20MAXVALUE%5Cn%29%3B%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22zcZjb%22%7D"></card>
